70
00:05:29,960 --> 00:05:32,060
I had to make many, many mistakes.

71
00:05:32,300 --> 00:05:36,240
And yet, I kept walking in
front of my younger brothers.

72
00:05:36,440 --> 00:05:38,020
And that made me strong.

73
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:47,000
What's he going on about, and how is
he still alive after bleeding so much?

74
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:57,920
The Death Paintings are
a mix of curse and human.

75
00:05:58,300 --> 00:06:02,300
They possess the unique ability to
convert cursed energy into blood.

76
00:06:02,660 --> 00:06:07,480
Until their cursed energy dries up,
they cannot die from blood loss.

77
00:06:33,760 --> 00:06:35,380
Why are my legs heavy?

78
00:06:36,160 --> 00:06:39,597
Did he harden the blood that
seeped into the fabric of my shoes?

79
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:41,020
Do you understand now?

80
00:06:42,280 --> 00:06:43,780
This is checkmate.

81
00:06:50,080 --> 00:06:51,962
Don't congratulate yourself yet.

82
00:06:53,140 --> 00:06:57,520
My technique traces my opponent's
future motions at 24 frames per second.

83
00:06:58,060 --> 00:07:01,640
This is only a minor hindrance,
and I can still move.

84
00:07:02,500 --> 00:07:04,040
Who missed his chance?

85
00:07:07,740 --> 00:07:09,916
Why isn't he striking out against me?

86
00:07:10,700 --> 00:07:14,817
Developed after grappling with his technique
for over a hundred and fifty years,

87
00:07:14,900 --> 00:07:16,780
