things in front of Yuji, Father.

112
00:09:29,580 --> 00:09:32,557
You'd be surprised at how
much a baby can remember.

113
00:09:32,640 --> 00:09:36,197
I know that the most important
thing for you was to have a child,

114
00:09:36,280 --> 00:09:39,277
and I'm sorry that you were
never able to do that with Kuroi.

115
00:09:39,360 --> 00:09:41,772
But, son, Kuroi died, and you know I'm...

116
00:09:43,160 --> 00:09:45,300
Now, father, why would you say that?

117
00:09:59,520 --> 00:10:01,420
I'm alive. But how?

118
00:10:19,780 --> 00:10:22,440
Oh, thank goodness.

119
00:10:30,340 --> 00:10:32,000
It was September, I think.

120
00:10:33,320 --> 00:10:35,791
Satoru Gojo went out of his way to see me.

121
00:10:36,120 --> 00:10:38,355
He asked me to always watch after you.

122
00:10:39,520 --> 00:10:42,620
So I had no choice but to put on that act.

123
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:44,180
