138
00:11:23,720 --> 00:11:24,550
Eh?

139
00:11:25,940 --> 00:11:30,597
This act was the best option to prevent
someone else from being sent to execute you.

140
00:11:30,680 --> 00:11:34,151
And to cut off any information
about you to others as well.

141
00:11:34,660 --> 00:11:36,895
Then again, they're not idiots either.

142
00:11:37,680 --> 00:11:40,137
So before they would approve
me as the executioner,

143
00:11:40,220 --> 00:11:43,514
