pact to make sure I did it.

144
00:11:43,660 --> 00:11:46,717
That's the reason I actually
had to kill you for a moment.

145
00:11:46,800 --> 00:11:48,380
I'm real sorry about that

146
00:11:49,960 --> 00:11:52,901
Wait, if you killed me,
then how am I still alive?

147
00:11:53,960 --> 00:11:55,372
Reverse curse technique.

148
00:11:55,900 --> 00:11:58,237
I used my reverse curse
technique the moment

149
00:11:58,320 --> 00:12:00,577
