immediately heal you!

150
00:12:00,660 --> 00:12:04,537
I figured it would work based upon all
the things I've heard about you before.

151
00:12:04,620 --> 00:12:05,940
I guess I was right.

152
00:12:06,440 --> 00:12:08,337
There aren't too many
people around who know

153
00:12:08,420 --> 00:12:11,185
