you're dead for a while.

158
00:12:22,240 --> 00:12:23,797
At least headquarters will.

159
00:12:23,880 --> 00:12:25,657
Think your death sentence was carried out.

160
00:12:25,740 --> 00:12:29,577
Why go this far?

161
00:12:29,660 --> 00:12:31,257
What's in it for you?

162
00:12:31,340 --> 00:12:32,677
I'm doing it.

163
00:12:32,760 --> 00:12:37,520
Because the people that I cherish also
happen to be people who cherish you.

164
00:12:39,820 --> 00:12:44,020
The power I shoulder I used to think
it was greater than I could bear.

165
00:12:44,660 --> 00:12:47,877
At first I thought the power
had been forced upon me.

166
00:12:47,960 --> 00:12:51,277
But it was really something
that I'd brought upon myself.

167
00:12:51,360 --> 00:12:53,257
I'm not like you.

168
00:12:53,340 --> 00:12:55,399
The power you shoulder isn't yours.

169
00:12:58,480 --> 00:12:59,780
It's not your fault.

170
00:13:06,040 --> 00:13:06,937
That's not true.

171
00:13:07,020 --> 00:13:08,377
You don't get it.

172
00:13:08,460 --> 00:13:10,197
It isn't a matter of
who's to blame or not.

173
00:13:10,280 --> 00:13:12,920
I killed them. It was me. It's a door.

174
00:13:18,780 --> 00:13:19,610
Fushiguro?

175
00:13:19,693 --> 00:13:20,637
What are you doing here?

176
00:13:20,720 --> 00:13:22,661
We're going back to Jujutsu High.

177
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:25,197
The barrier surrounding the
school has been weakened.

178
00:13:25,280 --> 00:13:27,577
It should be safe for you
to return there again.

179
00:13:27,660 --> 00:13:29,760
so long as no one sees your face.

180
00:13:30,160 --> 00:13:32,037
We'll meet up with the
upperclassmen and then...

181
00:13:32,120 --> 00:13:32,950
Stop it!

182
00:13:33,860 --> 00:13:37,036
Don't talk about it like
it's just another normal day.

183
00:13:37,700 --> 00:13:39,818
Don't just pretend it didn't happen.

184
00:13:41,040 --> 00:13:42,300
I killed people.

185
