A lot of people.

186
00:13:45,880 --> 00:13:48,097
It's because of me that
somebody are dead now!

187
00:13:48,180 --> 00:13:49,010
Because of us!

188
00:13:50,500 --> 00:13:52,206
Of course you would say that.

189
00:13:52,920 --> 00:13:54,320
You can't give up

190
