have to keep proving why we exist!

195
00:14:24,560 --> 00:14:26,180
You're wrong, Fujiwara.

196
00:14:26,780 --> 00:14:30,257
We don't have time to worry about
ourselves and our feelings anymore.

197
00:14:30,340 --> 00:14:31,280
Don't say that.

198
00:14:31,440 --> 00:14:33,120
We exist to save others.

199
00:14:33,740 --> 00:14:34,837
You'll end up suffering.

200
00:14:34,920 --> 00:14:37,557
I thought saving people was
your driving motivation.

201
00:14:37,640 --> 00:14:39,640
The whole time you stay around me.

202
00:14:39,900 --> 00:14:41,547
Start by saving me, Itadori.

203
00:14:46,360 --> 00:14:50,917
Noritoshi Kamo has set up a death game
between those he granted curse techniques.

204
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:52,240
The Culling Game.

205
00:14:55,120 --> 00:14:57,591
Tsumiki has been drawn into this game too.

206
00:15:00,760 --> 00:15:01,701
Itadori, please.

207
00:15:07,900 --> 00:15:09,400
I need your power.

208
00:15:50,360 --> 00:15:51,831
Okotsu, I need your help.

209
00:15:52,720 --> 00:15:55,602
Sukuna is plotting something
that uses Fushiguro.

210
00:15:55,900 --> 00:15:58,097
He was able to take
over my body in Shibuya

211
00:15:58,180 --> 00:16:00,900
after I was forced to
eat ten fingers at once.

212
00:16:01,840 --> 00:16:04,737
There's now a total of
fifteen fingers inside of me.

213
00:16:04,820 --> 00:16:07,097
Even if I'm fed the
remaining five all at once,

214
00:16:07,180 --> 00:16:10,121
I don't think he'll be
able to take me over again.

215
00:16:10,540 --> 00:16:14,277
But if he does, if Sukuna appears
and takes control of me again,

216
00:16:14,360 --> 00:16:15,654
I need you to kill me.

217
00:16:16,640 --> 00:16:18,640
Can I trust you to do that for me?

218
00:16:21,320 --> 00:16:22,177
Yes, of course.

219
00:16:22,260 --> 00:16:23,780
I promise I'll do it.

220
00:16:25,380 --> 00:16:26,210
Okay, Fushiguro.

221
00:16:26,293 --> 00:16:27,809
What do you need me to do?

222
00:16:28,680 --> 00:16:32,739
First, we go back to Jujutsu High,
and then make contact with Tengen.

223
00:16:35,420 --> 00:16:37,977
How can we release the
seal of the prison realm?

224
00:16:38,060 --> 00:16:41,980
What is Noritoshi Kamo's actual
goal, and what moves will he make?

225
00:16:42,800 --> 00:16:46,017
The Cullen Game is an unprecedented
act of Jujutsu terrorism,

226
00:16:46,100 --> 00:16:49,697
and we need answers to those
questions to resolve this situation.

227
00:16:49,780 --> 00:16:53,721
I think the Tengen might be the
only one capable of answering them.

228
00:16:54,140 --> 00:16:55,237
What about that woman?

229
00:16:55,320 --> 00:16:56,496
Maybe Tsukumo knows.

230
00:16:57,040 --> 00:16:58,864
I've already spoken to Tsukumo.

231
00:16:59,240 --> 00:17:01,534
In fact, this whole thing was her plan.

232
00:17:01,780 --> 00:17:04,074
She's also hiding away at Jujutsu High.

233
00:17:06,300 --> 00:17:07,594
Hiding away from what?

234
00:17:08,520 --> 00:17:11,097
Apparently, she doesn't want
to deal with the higher-ups.

235
00:17:11,180 --> 00:17:14,660
However, the problem is
Tengen's concealment barriers.

236
00:17:15,480 --> 00:17:19,539
Within the barriers, there are a
thousand constantly shuffling doors.

237
00:17:20,280 --> 00:17:23,900
Only one leads to the tombs of
the star where Tengen resides.

238
00:17:25,120 --> 00:17:29,200
So unless we pick the right
door, we can't meet with Tengen?

239
00:17:34,080 --> 00:17:36,660
I'm sorry, Fushikurl, but...

240
00:17:44,840 --> 00:17:46,560
I need to ask you something.

241
00:17:50,520 --> 00:17:52,380
What happened to Kugisaki?

242
00:17:59,640 --> 00:18:00,620
I see.

243
00:18:04,120 --> 00:18:05,060
All right.

244
00:18:13,080 --> 00:18:19,357
All right I understand so about
the concealment barriers I

245
00:18:19,440 --> 00:18:23,087
have a good workaround for that
How long has he been listening

246
00:18:25,180 --> 00:18:29,297
What's the workaround tell
us you remember when Mode

247
00:18:29,380 --> 00:18:31,897
stole Sukena's fingers and
the death with paintings,

248
00:18:31,980 --> 00:18:34,420
we're going to do the same thing.

249
00:18:44,020 --> 00:18:46,997
Well, it hasn't been that
long since the last time, huh?

250
00:18:47,080 --> 00:18:48,374
Maki, what a surprise.

251
00:18:49,500 --> 00:18:50,480
Oh, hello.

252
00:18:52,140 --> 00:18:54,380
Maki, is it safe for you to be up?

253
00:18:55,380 --> 00:18:56,851
Yeah, it's not a problem.

254
00:18:56,940 --> 00:18:59,058
Not much I could do about the burns.

255
00:18:59,440 --> 00:19:01,457
Reverse curse technique can erase scars.

256
00:19:01,540 --> 00:19:05,540
I have to say, your heavenly pact
of physical prowess is impressive.

257
00:19:05,720 --> 00:19:08,797
You saved your life with the
strength of your body's endurance.

258
00:19:08,880 --> 00:19:12,137
You didn't put faith in your
resistance to curses alone.

259
00:19:12,220 --> 00:19:14,137
That's a shame the clan
head didn't make it.

260
00:19:14,220 --> 00:19:17,044
It's not like it was a
competition or something.

261
00:19:18,120 --> 00:19:20,767
Megumi, how's it going
with Tengen's barrier?

262
00:19:22,320 --> 00:19:24,760
Well, you see, let me explain.

263
00:19:25,300 --> 00:19:28,877
On the way to the Tombs of the
Star, it's the Forbidden Vault.

264
00:19:28,960 --> 00:19:32,737
Inside that vault are Jujutsu-hai's
cursed tools and cursed objects,

265
00:19:32,820 --> 00:19:34,860
plus the remains of my brothers.

266
00:19:35,340 --> 00:19:40,600
Nuran-so, Choso, Tan-so,
Seance, Kotsu-so, and Choso.

267
00:19:41,200 --> 00:19:43,057
Even though it's just their remains,

268
00:19:43,140 --> 00:19:47,787
I should be able to sense their presence
using the side effect of my technique.

269
00:19:48,480 --> 00:19:49,500
Good for you.

270
00:19:50,180 --> 00:19:53,040
That's really great to
hear, but who are you?

271
00:19:56,860 --> 00:20:01,380
Well for now I guess you can
call him my older brother.

272
00:20:05,220 --> 00:20:06,050
Let's go.

273
00:20:09,100 --> 00:20:12,397
That's the one I'm
certain of it my younger

274
00:20:12,480 --> 00:20:14,957
brothers are resting
right beyond this door.

275
00:20:15,040 --> 00:20:16,140
I'm opening it.

276
00:20:26,900 --> 00:20:27,841
Let's head down.

277
00:20:29,740 --> 00:20:33,564
Further in, there's an elevator
leading to the tombs of the star.

278
00:20:34,520 --> 00:20:35,350
Choso!

279
00:20:36,480 --> 00:20:37,310
Coming.

280
00:20:38,340 --> 00:20:40,046
I'll come back for you later.

281
00:20:40,680 --> 00:20:42,445
Hang in there a little longer.

282
00:20:49,220 --> 00:20:50,050
Bloodstains?

283
00:20:50,133 --> 00:20:51,393
I wonder what happened.

284
00:20:51,720 --> 00:20:52,960
It was 12 years ago.

285
00:20:53,660 --> 00:20:57,425
Thinking back on it now, that's
when all the distortion started.

286
00:20:57,600 --> 00:20:59,718
Can't just be a coincidence, can it?

287
00:21:00,860 --> 00:21:02,036
All right, everyone.

288
00:21:02,160 --> 00:21:03,984
The main hall is just up ahead.

289
00:21:19,020 --> 00:21:19,997
There's nothing here.

290
00:21:20,080 --> 00:21:21,697
This is the main hall.

291
00:21:21,780 --> 00:21:22,897
No.

292
00:21:22,980 --> 00:21:25,100
He's declining to speak with us.

293
00:21:25,680 --> 00:21:27,477
Tengen won't interfere with reality.

294
00:21:27,560 --> 00:21:31,377
I thought if there was ever a
chance to reach him it would be now.

295
00:21:31,460 --> 00:21:33,177
All the six eyes are sealed away.

296
00:21:33,260 --> 00:21:35,317
I was obviously naive.

297
00:21:35,400 --> 00:21:41,440
It's not all of us being
rejected but just me.

298
00:21:45,120 --> 00:21:46,577
We should head back.

299
00:21:46,660 --> 00:21:48,719
Tsumiki doesn't have time to spare.

300
00:21:50,680 --> 00:21:52,420
Leaving so soon?

301
00:21:53,780 --> 00:21:56,700
It's nice to meet you, child of Zenin,

302
00:21:57,040 --> 00:22:01,780
descendant of Michizane, cursed
wound death painting, and at last...

303
00:22:03,320 --> 00:22:05,360
It's the vessel of Sukuna.

304
00:23:39,880 --> 00:23:41,877
I must impose one condition.

305
00:23:41,960 --> 00:23:43,877
We came here to learn how
to open the prison route.

306
00:23:43,960 --> 00:23:44,997
No greeting for me?

307
00:23:45,080 --> 00:23:46,757
Then why is this calling game?

308
00:23:46,840 --> 00:23:48,677
To force the evolution of mankind.

309
00:23:48,760 --> 00:23:50,937
It's better for the rules if
being stripped means death, too.

310
00:23:51,020 --> 00:23:53,357
If Sukuna takes control again,
don't hesitate to kill me.

311
00:23:53,440 --> 00:23:54,616
Don't die out there.
